<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dong Kuk Steel '96 net rises.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dong Kuk Steel '96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			3,695     vs	  950</p>
<p>    Net				   79.54  vs	   20.74</p>
<p>    Turnover			 1,069.52  vs	1,012.33</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		55.8   vs	 none</p>
<p>NOTE - Dong Kuk Steel Mill Co Ltd said its share capital in 1996 was unchanged at 23.4 million shares. A Dong Kuk official said the extraordinary profit came from sale of property in Pusan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
